{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121088","id":4014133823,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7vQtI_","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121088","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121088.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121088.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121088","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121088/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121088/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121088/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/db8d86017fb8dd099bf15b8e25d27b5c8e0f4cf1","number":121088,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[DRAFT] Add option to build tracy-profiler client as a shared lib","user":{"login":"enetheru","id":1720718,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjA3MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1720718?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru","html_url":"https://github.com/enetheru","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR introduces a build option \"tracy_as_shared\"(subject to renaming) and appropriate changes to the build system to compile TracyClient as a shared library. The reason this needs to come from Godot itself is because building a GDExtension against the shared library needs to match exactly the build options the engine uses for tracy, or there will highly likely be errors.\r\n\r\n**Motivation:**\r\n\r\nCurrently tracy-profiler can not be used to profile the engine and GDExtension simultaneously.\r\nThere are no known issues, or proposals addressing this that I found, however there have been a few discussions requesting, or lamenting this fact.\r\n\r\n- **Forum posts:**\r\n\t- https://forum.godotengine.org/t/does-new-godot4-6-tracy-profiler-support-works-with-gdextension-dlls/132830/6\r\n- ***Discord Chats:**\r\n\t- https://discord.com/channels/1235157165589794909/1259879534392774748/1518526225453285400\r\n\t- https://discord.com/channels/1235157165589794909/1235321874607771810/1498936198108811305\r\n \r\n**Technical overview:**\r\n\r\nBuild system changes only primarily confined to the core/profiling build scripts. \r\nConditionally create a shared library from the tracy source pointed to by the profiler_path\r\nCopy the library, sidecar files, and the `profiling.gen.h` to the bin directory next to the godot binary.\r\n\r\nUsers who wish to build their GDExtension against the TracyClient shared library include the `profiling.gen.h` to match the build flags used in the engine.\r\n\r\n**Testing:**\r\n\r\nI have an example [godot-cpp-template](https://github.com/enetheru/godot-cpp-template/tree/godot-shared-tracy) demonstrating this using CMake, and will follow up with a Scons before taking this out of Draft.\r\n\r\n**Discussion:**\r\n\r\nAs this work is guarded by a build option, I see no impact to existing users who use tracy to profile their games.\r\n\r\n**Additional work:** \r\n\r\nCurrently only tested on Windows with MSVC, soon to be tested with multiple toolchains on windows, Linux and MacOS.\r\nOf particular concern to me is the ease of use. Getting a GDExtension built is difficult for most people as it is, I really don't want to make it harder, or add to the support burden.\r\n\r\nIf necessary I can write up a tutorial of sorts once I have the GDExtension SCons example, and have tested against multiple platform/toolchain combinations.\r\n\r\nI also want to follow this up with additional work to make this unnecessary for the average user by adding profiling globals, or builtin objects to facilitate tracing. However this direct access to tracy is a better avenue for seasoned developers.\r\n\r\n***PRChecklist:**\r\n\r\n- AI used as a search engine and research tool. I actually like writing code, so handing it off to AI robs me of that joy.","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-07-08T11:46:39Z","updated_at":"2026-07-14T02:38:32Z","closed_at":"2026-07-14T02:31:02Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"b797b01265a7aab263bbb07765ccb605839107db","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"enetheru:tracy-shared","ref":"tracy-shared","repo":{"id":765566646,"node_id":"R_kgDOLaGetg","name":"godot","full_name":"enetheru/godot","owner":{"login":"enetheru","id":1720718,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjA3MTg